abstract: "Shared formal mathematics with separate high-temperature and low-temperature manuscripts, theorem endpoints and verification procedures. High-temperature: complete disordered-phase susceptibility, all odd orders, HT-1.0 / Lean 1747. Low-temperature: connected ordered pure-phase susceptibility, all even orders, manuscript v0.1-rc6 / Lean v0.3.0-rc2. Manuscripts and authored documentation use CC BY 4.0. Historical low-temperature citations and releases retain their original scope."
